S3        = Object Storage (Photos, Videos, Documents)
EBS       = Block Storage (EC2 Hard Disk)
EFS       = Shared File Storage (Multiple EC2 Instances)
RDS       = Relational Database (SQL)
DynamoDB  = NoSQL Database
Aurora    = High-Performance Relational Database
ElastiCache = In-Memory Cache
Redshift  = Analytics & Data Warehousing
